! Proposed Definitions And Examples

{BOX()}
!! mu'e (NU1)

!!! Proposed Definition
mu'e is an event abstractor with the place structure x1 is a point event of (the bridi). It takes a bridi and wraps it into an event that is considered a single point in time, devoid of internal structure.

!!! Proposed Keywords
* point event abstractor

!!! See Also
* {nu}
* {co'i}

!!! Examples of ''mu'e'' Usage
;.i le mu'e le cribe lanzu cu klamu'o le tersla cu pu'o lerci: The arrival of the bear family at the party was before they were late (le la BERenstein. cribe .e. le jinga guzmrkukurbita)

{BOX}

